    \cf13 func\cf12  \cf14 flowerTimer\cf12 (\cf13 _\cf12  title: \cf15 String\cf12 , last: \cf15 Date\cf12 , interval: \cf15 Int\cf12 ) -> \cf13 some\cf12  \cf15 View\cf12  \{\
